<description>&lt;p&gt;Houthi forces attempted an attack on the Saudi Aramco facility in Riyadh, prompting condemnation from Pakistan. The Baloch Army executed seven individuals it identified as Pakistani agents, while the Tehrik-i-Taliban Pakistan killed police officers in Khyber Pakhtunkhwa. In Hangu, a police constable was killed and three officers were abducted during an attack on a checkpost. The conflict still accounts for 1,794 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxOSjhhZzlJeHBXWDRBRzY4SjB3eF8wUlRWS25YOGF4S0ZfemxqMm5nQmJhemhQXzNJcVdCVF9mcDQwX21xSnRmZHpVcWRJMmlLX1lvN2xLaFNFeXVSbHctbHVyQnZNZVE1ZkZLVElWeGVacmdmV3ZicDEwUzYxRHZENFVFenMyMU1NbVJmOVRGX0R0MTU5bkVnV3p2cjBUWjJkbjRLLWpaNXhUanFMS25uVjBleU_SAboBQVVfeXFMTkd1ZjRpcThWQ0ROQXdTSGoyOFVpZlplY25TbWhOOW55a2lablJVVE1rWGF0QVNndzBZanVzY3VfTEdpYlo2bktMWEV3MzFhN21qRjNTUF9oUjRSZHFLb2hJWTBvRWZFTmlfQ29Gc256cFJpUkhDOVhmd0dScVJ4TUhwVjN4UTB0MF9VWXprNGlvQkMxa0NJWThuakMyUjZ4R0RvSnZnLV9wTnJzYkdfeFhLVjNSZ1J5Mzln?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sportstar&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxPMU43QmdIXzFiUU5oZmJFUjQyY3l1WnJFZ241WE1yUFpUVDkxdG8xTm9JS1pybUxyLVN4bVdvaV9iQUxqV0VZbXdnS0lSc0tfek1DenE0NTFhdlNYVHJURlE4aFBhVkpiWEhJOXp1N2RMUzhtekF5LUlfQ3FDN0lMMUxSN2NhU19CclRIaXAxeXV6Zk82ejh1d3RSZnFtY1BqZ2pObFdzU2NxYWow?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Nation (Pakistan )&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Organiser&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;News18&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Week&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Times Now&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&